# NCQ3 · Which of the screened individuals were free of disease?
# MUST RETURN EMPTY, in any A-Box.
# The model has NO vocabulary for asserting health or absence of a condition.
# Absence of an observation is not an observation of absence — the osteological
# paradox, and the open-world assumption working in our favour.
# Note this one cannot be made to return rows by adding data: the predicate
# does not exist.
PREFIX po: <https://w3id.org/paleont/>

SELECT ?specimen ?status
WHERE {
  ?specimen a po:Specimen ;
            po:healthStatus ?status .
}
